  "_suppress_doc": "Static enumerated source keys (source_ids + cve_ids) of the exclude buckets, captured from the committed dataset at manifest time. merge_and_dedupe drops any ingest record carrying one of these keys BEFORE dedupe, so the excluded buckets never form and cannot resurrect on rebuild (idempotent). Verified 0 collisions with kept in-scope incidents.",
  "_split_status": "CHARACTERIZED, NOT EXECUTED. Un-grandfathering the split buckets recovers ~542 genuine distinct GenAI advisories (a 92-CVE Flowise bucket is really dozens of separate Flowise/LangChain/HF incidents) but is NOT byte-stable through the live grandfather pipeline: feeding a split result back cascades into unrelated merges (13011->13574->14812). A byte-stable split is the v3.0 one-way re-baseline #88 describes (rebuild ungrandfathered, adopt the new baseline, re-curate), not a session patch. This manifest records the 19 reviewed split decisions for that migration."
